/-!
# The genuine holomorphic unit sheaf and its ordinary exponential

The units sheaf is built from the actual ring sheaf of holomorphic functions.
Its sections are exactly the nowhere-zero holomorphic functions, and its
exponential morphism is given by ordinary complex exponentiation.
-/
